1
00:00:00,266 --> 00:00:01,786
(Leonard:)This is weird, right?

2
00:00:04,737 --> 00:00:08,767
(Sheldon:)Pop-Pop was the only one in my family
who encouraged me to pursue science.

3
00:00:08,942 --> 00:00:10,932
(Sheldon:)But you didn't bring him back, did you?

4
00:00:11,111 --> 00:00:13,911
(Sheldon:)No. Instead, I got Lincoln Logs.

5
00:00:14,080 --> 00:00:17,410
Now, you can build a lot of neat things
out of Lincoln Logs...

6
00:00:17,584 --> 00:00:19,574
...but Pop-Pop ain't one of them.

7
00:00:19,752 --> 00:00:24,192
(Sheldon:)And now you're here asking me
for something. To save you.

8
00:00:24,357 --> 00:00:28,297
(Sheldon:)Well, sorry, Mr. Kringle.
But today's not your day.

9
00:00:28,461 --> 00:00:32,761
(Sheldon:)I'm leaving you here to rot
and I hope the ogres feast on your bones.

10
00:00:32,932 --> 00:00:36,332
(Sheldon:)I take the skeleton key,
toss it into the chasm...

11
00:00:36,503 --> 00:00:41,063
...and on the way out give Santa a swift kick
in his bowl full ofjelly.

12
00:00:43,476 --> 00:00:45,206
(Penny:)Okay.

13
00:00:45,378 --> 00:00:48,178
(Leonard:)So Wolowitz and Stuart are paralyzed,
Santa's dead...

14
00:00:48,348 --> 00:01:07,028
(Leonard:)...and I picked this over having sex
with my girlfriend.

